      "culture": "Sharing food, and arguing over who pays, are both very common in Iraqi life, and tea (\"چاي\", served strong in a small glass) is offered to almost every guest. \"بالعافية\" while someone is eating and \"صحة وعافية\" once they finish are fixed courtesies, each answered with a short blessing such as \"الله يعافيك\".",
